              },
              "denominator": {
                "value": 24,
                "unit": "hours"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Warned about anticholinergic side effects including dry mouth, blurred vision, confusion and urinary retention. Avoid driving if vision or cognition is affected."
          }
        ]
